await writeFile('dist/index.md',`# Perth Coastal Gardens\n\n> Garden rejuvenation information and project enquiries for Perth's northern coastal suburbs.\n\n## What this website covers\n\nPerth Coastal Gardens focuses on established gardens affected by fast-draining sandy soil, coastal exposure, dry summers and changing household needs. It provides practical information and an enquiry pathway rather than representing a physical storefront.\n\n## Services\n\n- [Garden rejuvenation](${domain}/services/garden-rejuvenation/)\n- [Sandy-soil improvement](${domain}/services/sandy-soil-improvement/)\n- [Waterwise landscaping](${domain}/services/waterwise-landscaping/)\n- [Reticulation assessment and upgrades](${domain}/services/reticulation-upgrades/)\n\n## Service area\n\nMullaloo, Joondalup and nearby northern coastal suburbs of Perth, Western Australia. Coverage and provider availability must be confirmed for each property.\n\n## Useful resources\n\n- [All garden services](${domain}/services/)\n- [Northern coastal service area](${domain}/locations/)\n- [Perth coastal garden advice](${domain}/blog/)\n- [Frequently asked questions](${domain}/faq/)\n- [Contact Perth Coastal Gardens](${domain}/contact/)\n\n## Accuracy\n\nCurrent photographs illustrate local conditions and design ideas rather than completed client projects. This Markdown version does not imply unverified testimonials, ratings, years in business, qualifications, guarantees, response times or project totals. Contractor-specific details must be confirmed directly.\n\n## Contact\n\n- Phone: ${phone}\n- Email: ${email}\n`);
await writeFile('dist/_headers',`/*\n  Vary: Accept\n\n/\n  Link: </index.md>; rel="alternate"; type="text/markdown", </llms.txt>; rel="describedby"\n\n/index.md\n  Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8\n  X-Markdown-Tokens: 310\n  X-Robots-Tag: noindex\n  Vary: Accept\n  X-AEO-Version: 1.0\n\n/llms.txt\n  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n  X-Robots-Tag: noindex\n`);
await writeFile('dist/llms.txt',`# Perth Coastal Gardens\n\n> Garden rejuvenation information and enquiry website for Perth's northern coastal suburbs.\n\n## Core topics\n- Garden rejuvenation on sandy coastal soils\n- Sandy-soil improvement\n- Waterwise landscaping\n- Reticulation assessment and upgrades\n\n## Service area\nMullaloo, Joondalup and nearby northern coastal suburbs of Perth, Western Australia.\n\n## Key pages\n- ${domain}/services/\n- ${domain}/locations/\n- ${domain}/blog/\n- ${domain}/faq/\n- ${domain}/contact/\n\n## Contact\n- Phone: ${phone}\n- Email: ${email}\n\nImages illustrate local conditions and design ideas and are not represented as completed client projects. Contractor-specific claims must be confirmed directly.\n\nSitemap: ${domain}/sitemap.xml\n`);
await writeFile('dist/llms-full.txt',`# Perth Coastal Gardens — detailed site guide\n\nPerth Coastal Gardens is an independently owned online lead-generation and garden-information website. It helps homeowners describe garden rejuvenation projects and request contact from a suitable service provider. It does not represent a physical storefront.\n\nThe editorial focus is the relationship between Perth's sandy coastal soils, water movement, planting, mulch, lawn and reticulation. Core service information covers complete garden rejuvenation, sandy-soil improvement, waterwise landscaping and reticulation assessment. Location information focuses on Mullaloo, Joondalup and the connected northern coastal corridor.\n\nThe Garden Advice library contains general educational guides. Property-specific assessment is required before selecting treatments, materials or plants. Current images are illustrative rather than portfolio evidence. No ratings, reviews, project totals, years in business, licence claims, response times or guarantees should be inferred unless later published with verification.\n\nAuthoritative navigation: ${domain}/services/ | ${domain}/locations/ | ${domain}/blog/ | ${domain}/faq/ | ${domain}/contact/\nContact: ${phone} | ${email}\nSitemap: ${domain}/sitemap.xml\n`);
await writeFile('dist/_redirects',`https://www.perthcoastgardens.com/* https://perthcoastgardens.com/:splat 301\n`);
await writeFile('dist/favicon.svg',`<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><rect width="64" height="64" rx="18" fill="#173642"/><path d="M12 38c12-4 18-15 25-24 7 14 15 21 15 31-7-7-15-10-24-9 7 3 13 8 17 15-14 1-25-3-33-13Z" fill="#4F7462"/><path d="M15 44c12-7 24-9 36-5" fill="none" stroke="#D9C7A3" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>`);
